!/skills/**
# skills/synced/ is Anthropic's OWN built-in skill packages (docx/pdf/pptx/xlsx/google-workspace/
# mcp-builder reference docs, several MB of vendored XSD schemas), synced under a random UUID pair —
# not config the owner authored. Re-excluded so this repo stays "the owner's config", not a mirror of
# Anthropic's bundled skill content.
/skills/synced/
!/commands/
!/commands/**
!/output-styles/
!/output-styles/**
!/themes/
!/themes/**
!/mcp/
!/mcp/**

# Guardias propias — código + manifiesto de registro sí, estado/runs en vivo NO (pueden citar texto
